            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Jarvis asks to take notes where you'll see it.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.22</h2>
<ul>
  <li>"Take notes" is now a bigger pill in the top-right corner, with Jarvis's owl and one round button to start.</li>
  <li>While recording, the pill shows the owl, the voices on the call and the time. After you stop, "Saved ›" opens your notes.</li>
  <li>If nobody has spoken for 5 minutes, Jarvis asks "Meeting over?". Still silent after 15 minutes, it stops and saves the notes.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
